=200&s=14e1d4dce91dc30e5180ab9257865a8d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI love your art style!! Could you draw my serval OC? Feel free to choose the pose and setting - I’d just love it if you could give him a cool new outfit. Whatever you come up with would be amazing. Thanks!\n\nhttps://oc.choop.place/choop", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marimoyasya/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/00b2f376/uploads/origins/d8d61a4b-6b05-41e8-b746-8b62e28b92a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=168f67e361b8df67c4a4439ef79a6a6d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/00b2f376/uploads/origins/d8d61a4b-6b05-41e8-b746-8b62e28b92a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=168f67e361b8df67c4a4439ef79a6a6d, https://si.imgix.net/00b2f376/uploads/origins/d8d61a4b-6b05-41e8-b746-8b62e28b92a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a610c5d84d0837e5d351b71c86c898ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/00b2f376/uploads/origins/d8d61a4b-6b05-41e8-b746-8b62e28b92a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0be4a7686db0b13adf1a3e4bf549cf6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'm interested in a coloured sketch sheet of my DnD character. He is a victorian doctor who is also a werewolf.\nHe has black hair that's tied in a low ponytail with some grey hairs due to his age. His facial hair is also black and grey. He has green eyes and pale skin with some dark lines under his eyes. He has a monocle that he wears around his neck so he can easily bring it up to his eye to read. \nHis wolf form is black and grey like his hair, his ponytail remains in his wolf form as well as his facial hair that appears in the fur of his face. I'm interested in one coloured sketch of his human form and one of his full werewolf form with another rough non-coloured sketch of his face semi transformed showing his shoulders s